# Dregscape Zombie's unearth {B} (CR 702.84a): discarded to Faithless Looting, it is unearthed from the graveyard (one mana
# short the ability is not offered) with Moxen worth exactly {B}, leaving the pool empty. It has haste and attacks for 2, and
# is exiled at the beginning of the next end step.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Faithless Looting
Dregscape Zombie
Mox Jet
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x24

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Dregscape Zombie; Island)
! Bot1.Graveyard.Dregscape Zombie.Activate(Ability: Unearth; Mana: short)
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Graveyard.Dregscape Zombie.Activate(Ability: Unearth)
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Mana = 
Bot1.Attack(Dregscape Zombie > Bot2)
[Bot1.End]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 18
Exile = Dregscape Zombie
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Mox Ruby
Bot1.Graveyard = Faithless Looting; Island
